# Where the trading server lives. Copy to .env.local and edit.
#
# Leave both unset in development: the app then talks to port 4000 on the
# machine running Metro (the Expo dev server's own host), which works from a
# phone on the same Wi-Fi and from an emulator.
#
# Android emulator with `adb reverse tcp:4000 tcp:4000`: http://localhost:4000
# Production: the public HTTPS origin of the API (the one Nginx fronts).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
# Defaults to the API URL with ws(s):// and /ws appended.
EXPO_PUBLIC_WS_URL=
